{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "cc4443853461031099c4253463d7b307ace1302e2685f592ebcb95c8dda98c08", "ja": "反省期間3日", "zh": "反省期间三天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6b50a0560cc450c4240c241c0c9773d3a79855421f3ea10b6997a364892dc8c5", "ja": "公演が盛況のうちに終わり、劇場で打ち\n上げパーティーが開かれることに。いつも\nと変わらないにぎやかな風景。亜美だけは\n3日間反省することを決意しつつ、\nメンバー達は次なる伝説へと歩き出す。", "zh": "公演在盛况中落幕，\n大家在剧场举行庆功宴，\n热闹的光景与平常无异。\n在只有亚美决定花三天反省的状态下，\n成员们将一起迈向下一个传说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "02a7b3e58d0ae152a93c19a5dd1d002c2024c8982b2fd5aecb39aef94ad6cd34", "ja": "（公演は、圧倒的な盛り上がりで幕を閉じた。\n今日はささやかだが、劇場で打ち上げパーティーだ！）", "zh": "（公演在空前的盛况中落幕了。\n今天要在剧场举行小小的庆功宴！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "46c6808b7ded3a3f98218e99a64829c62d186815dc2179a9735574ab093eb6c7", "ja": "うう、見たこともないようなごちそうがいっぱい……！\n{$P$}、私、一生忘れないかもっ！", "zh": "呜呜，有好多没看过的料理……！\n{$P$}，我可能一辈子都忘不了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6490eb97c3622442e83435dea8880db624c8002fe970d4513b5851fac6ae6dbb", "ja": "いや、そんなに高い料理じゃないんだ、ごめんな。\nけど俺のみんなへの、精一杯のねぎらいの気持ちだよ。", "zh": "不，这不是那么高级的料理，抱歉啊。\n不过，这是我竭尽全力想慰劳大家的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "bd46b84fb9e509dfa8d81af1caf8eb3f1b7d352b741dfb27c7e1a40ec1427787", "ja": "はいはーい、この辺でゲームをやっちゃうよー！\nみんな食べながらでいいから、ミミで亜美に注目っ！", "zh": "注意注意──亚美现在要玩一个游戏喔──！\n大家边吃边看就好，用耳朵看着亚美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "4d2ff814e938136a909b9f100e828b69197847935afee25d0d3902cf77a8d938", "ja": "難しいこと言うわね……。\nで、何をやるつもりなの、亜美？", "zh": "这个要求还真难……\n然后呢，你想做什么啊，亚美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "36a1d09c8538db6bd62b8e5e538d01a0c2a73be6e490ec02d6441595812abfff", "ja": "んっとね、今から、兄ちゃんで遊ぶよ！\n……あ、間違えた。兄ちゃんと遊ぶよ！", "zh": "那个啊，亚美现在要用大哥哥玩游戏喔！\n……啊，说错了，是要跟大哥哥玩游戏喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "e55d54105b4c47e814f63a1d969be3a7928c87b310a8f499fbbc98ec35f26884", "ja": "じゃじゃーん！　今からやるのは、\n『おみくじ指令書ゲーム』でーすっ！", "zh": "锵锵──！\n现在要玩的是『抽签指令游戏』喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "01fca882ad0b7867f08219be39b88b0a2627ca51d2fdb5c144ee5749de519726", "ja": "うぎゃーーーー！？", "zh": "呜呀────！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3b81a02a54cd8bf089b83c16d264b676da25a4a7ae4e9db3eaed679c53ed5caf", "ja": "って急にどうした、響！？\nもしかして、またハム蔵が服の中に入ったのか！？", "zh": "忽然大叫是怎么了，响！？\n难道是哈姆藏又跑到衣服里了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "bbd0dbdb29bf47c8a62ca90eed41c9de6276468a297d9113d22f63b2409c8dd3", "ja": "ちがうぞ～。このシュウマイが硬ずぎて……。　\nうう、こんなの歯が欠けちゃうでしょ～！", "zh": "不是啦～是这个烧卖太硬了……\n呜呜，吃这种东西牙齿会断掉吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "78c60c54f8a768e8693a61a89c67fd578e216ab6a4ac4f09eda00e03f4d6e836", "ja": "あっ、ダメだよ、ひびきん！\nそれゲームで使うやつなのにー！", "zh": "啊，不行啦，响仔！\n那是游戏要用的耶──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "1c3d689fd4817707efb6e6a2f7f1fa9912a8b59ac34db30e44e1bcd13d9aa974", "ja": "シュウマイの中に、亜美が用意したおみくじ入りの\nカプセルが入ってるんだよ。", "zh": "烧卖里面有亚美准备好的胶囊，\n胶囊里面有签纸喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "0e2c2a6b4b05b40dc07c123a91ecd940566100e9e24195bd9da35d515e047cd3", "ja": "でね、おみくじに指令が書いてあって、みんな、\nその指令書通りにしないといけないってゲームなんだ！", "zh": "然后，签纸上写了指令，大家必须按照指令行动，\n就是这样的游戏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "19ba431b399848b38561ccafc12698f286f234374c92aa61c5483dc0aa967de8", "ja": "ふーん。でもこの指令書……、\n{$P$}への指令ばっかりじゃない？", "zh": "是喔。但是这些指令字条……\n不都是针对{$P$}的指令吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "951c2fbc0bf1e4ddfbbc6fd88ed92aaac480c6eac9915976491d0c08dd9a0e07", "ja": "あっ、ほんとだ。「{$P$}は、\n5人の中で、お嫁さんにしたい人の名前を言う……」", "zh": "啊，真的耶。「{$P$}要说出\n五人里想娶谁当老婆……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "1bbe4b49ee2b33b1ff4ae4c69515748121416e25aaaf598209bf4bb9f6da26ee", "ja": "こっちは、「{$P$}は、5人から\n1人を選んでお姫さま抱っこする」って書いてあるね！", "zh": "这边写的是「{$P$}要\n从五人里选一人做公主抱」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "45fdbb78d8c959e5264c8e69abaef1bfcdb758ed4e638835d29ab2ec62e578af", "ja": "うあうあ！　ふたりとも、なんで勝手にあけるの！？\nそれじゃ台なしだよ！　台がナッシングだよ！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊！你们干嘛自己打开来啊！？\n这下子就白准备了！准备都白搭了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2079e682e5779a0a6b1f74e7c33bc0c9c22b0273a12fb7d05545f3b09b13dca3", "ja": "つまり……これはゲームじゃなくて、\n単なる俺へのイタズラってことだよな、亜美？", "zh": "也就是说……这不是游戏，\n纯粹是针对我的恶作剧吧，亚美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "a6ad186223de99e39cbc003cb837d1c74e43ee3c421f1856114f162225406576", "ja": "そ、ソンナコトナイデース。", "zh": "没……没、有、这、回、事、喔──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "186f9927762295fb049a4e6ab8813b3754849d19c8ccde67769b51e3d5281e09", "ja": "だから誰なのよ、それは。……でも、たしかにちょっと\n聞いてみたかったわね。その、お嫁さん……とか……。", "zh": "你到底是在学谁说话啊……不过，确实有点想知道呢，\n那个，老婆……之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "774d79fae324439ec2570717f9cdcdf8c5479b93d0a4af57a1992b52479592c4", "ja": "え？　そうなのか？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "be0f6c1abfe6750dfb63a0415eb8084142c0f0299bf25ecad4423e6b5c27e732", "ja": "え？　そうって……\nた、ただの好奇心に決まってるでしょ！？", "zh": "咦？什么这样……\n我、我当然只是因为好奇啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "972f9cbe3729a19bc1121a73842fef07271ff9c3037b1c04e6347c45e083f244", "ja": "まさかアンタ、本気にしたんじゃないでしょうね！？\nキモいわ、この変態！　ド変態！　レジェンド変態！！", "zh": "你该不会当真了吧！？\n真恶心，你这个变态！大变态！传说级变态！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "fa7d0466305dbb1ff7c0847749649afec193462b8e511cb6b659569c4a955255", "ja": "（伝説レベルでののしられてしまった……。\nとか独白してる場合じゃない！　話を変えなくては！）", "zh": "（被唾骂到传说级了……\n现在不是说这种独白的时候！得改变话题才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "edf51987efcd1c77c1370b688d4c97894320f4d4d7e87c71ae0df717a9e6148d", "ja": "えーっと、とにかく、みんな！\n改めてレジェンドデイズ公演……、お疲れさま！", "zh": "呃──总之，各位！\n我要郑重说一声，『Legend Days』公演……辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1025_005yay", "source_sha256": "adbe3c49dcd73984a36cf930fbb038b9b9216e3834fea448a76598b386dad0e3", "ja": "お疲れ様でーっす、{$P$}！\n……あの、響さん。そろそろ、どうですかー？", "zh": "辛苦了──{$P$}！\n……那个，阿响姊姊，差不多了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "c378c9496f52a07fc63c442c69dcbb93e91b03f84ae45d0edfef7061035530fb", "ja": "あっ、そうだねっ！　えっと、気を取り直して……。\n実は{$P$}にプレゼントがあるんだ！", "zh": "啊，说得也是！呃，那就正式开始……\n其实我们有礼物要送给{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "e2a506fad6866fe8cc728b956ee37043589cdf0b1857ac93516ebdc778b8ef80", "ja": "はい！　たいしたものじゃないんですけど、私達も\n{$P$}をねぎらいたかったので。", "zh": "送给你！虽然不是很贵重的东西，\n但我们也想慰劳{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a48bd9fd74b869e0c93d185d166b463e61aa4eed0cc740411cc1de27ef0630a7", "ja": "えっ、この袋……俺に？　ありがとう、みんな！！\nえっと、中身は……ん？　これは……？", "zh": "咦？这一袋……要送我？谢谢你们！！\n我看看，里面是……嗯？这是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1030_007ior", "source_sha256": "138b9eaae73cddd2088ec6e5be58cfc470d17cd0322a37639cabb2019daaccea", "ja": "缶詰のセットよ。私はこういうの、あまり食べたこと\nないんだけど、美味しいんですってね。", "zh": "是罐头组合喔。我没怎么吃过这种东西，\n但听说很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "a83bf94269bc3fa11f70d2f75d41e9c2036f01ffdaf921a15f38dfa356ae76c1", "ja": "みんなで相談して、飾り気ないですけど、\n実用品にしたんです。夜食にもなるし保存もきくし。", "zh": "大家一起商量后，决定送简单实用的东西。\n这个可以当宵夜，保存期限也很久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "118c501146acd2e0734e46bd69892801da31d032ff08510ad2ed221210d4d5bc", "ja": "あ、ああ、実用品はすごくありがたいけど……。\nこれ……もう全部、食べられてるぞ……？", "zh": "呃、嗯，我非常感谢你们送实用的东西……\n但是这些……全都被吃光了喔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "3cd53410d6f518e6cfc1ee5b4883fd7cf962d5d9fd43da820cd49730b67d0de5", "ja": "……え？\nうぎゃー、ホントだ！　空き缶ばっかりだぞ！", "zh": "……咦？\n呜呀──真的耶！里面全都是空罐喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1034_005yay", "source_sha256": "5b6ab3a0b5e38ea3143ce063088451cd005a56f1404a0d217c3910381f0c8a4e", "ja": "ど、どうして……缶の中身だけ迷子ですか！？\nうう、なんかそれって、こわいかも～。", "zh": "为、为什么……只有罐头里面的食物失踪了！？\n呜呜，总觉得这样有点可怕～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "05a767f7071e11c9e9b5062effbf1e0d7675b60a83af0be1d4e67983654b6c3e", "ja": "それは、さすがにないでしょ。\n疑いたくはないけど、犯人は……この中にいるわ！", "zh": "怎么可能是失踪。\n我不想多做怀疑，但犯人……就在我们之中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1038_011ami", "source_sha256": "0a2218d959a0f3cf4129f5509cd737ce6a8735b5c85d00cc2f6fd51ec02c38a7", "ja": "うあうあ～、刑事さんごめんなさーい！\n勘弁してくださーい！！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊～刑警小姐对不起──！\n请放过亚美吧──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1039_011ami", "source_sha256": "0665af76296408992fc9a49d03e91bf72ee640f6a49de3bb2ca65957e5f2592d", "ja": "亜美、兄ちゃんのプレゼントだって忘れてて……\nゲームの準備してたら、お腹へって、つい～。", "zh": "亚美忘记那是大哥哥的礼物……\n在准备游戏的时候肚子饿了，一不小心就吃掉了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1040_007ior", "source_sha256": "5fdc916f6211691125cfea6dd1daadc510c3c6fb88613275bbe79acfe156863f", "ja": "あっさり自白したわね。それにしたって、\nなんで全部きれいさっぱり食べちゃうのよ！？", "zh": "你自首得真干脆呢。但就算这样，\n为什么全都吃得一干二净了啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1041_011ami", "source_sha256": "f58c61a3efe4f2b31362540a1992c5e142e5f8d14bd15b9f0c6d82bb03cc067f", "ja": "うう、亜美のお腹の中には、腹ペコ魔人がいるのかも。\n兄ちゃん、ごめんよ～！　何でもするから許して～！", "zh": "呜呜，亚美的肚子里可能有饿扁扁魔人。大哥哥，\n对不起～！亚美什么都愿意做，你原谅亚美吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1042_p", "source_sha256": "2076f168bd71e1817a53c5222eafbe8af1f7e08f17cac9847d2c2402b6d2674a", "ja": "何でも……か。\nじゃあ、打ち上げの片付けを頼もうかな。", "zh": "什么都愿意……是吗？\n那就拜托你在庆功宴结束后帮忙整理吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1043_p", "source_sha256": "2a2b5c22a20782b28e91b052017d23b8ae7a5a74d4520df62cf755fb066320b1", "ja": "給湯室の掃除と、廊下の雑巾がけと、あと……。", "zh": "还有打扫茶水间、擦走廊地板，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1044_011ami", "source_sha256": "babc88f712cb68458d91051bf54e3f068b706394fc02ab84276fcb4045edb4c3", "ja": "に、兄ちゃん……目がマジだよ？\nそんなに缶詰、食べたかったの？", "zh": "大、大哥哥……你的眼神很认真耶。\n你这么想吃罐头吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1045_p", "source_sha256": "f01552742e23e3908252bbf55612a459b82c1b9d1f643a0116d7464f99d01e87", "ja": "いや、ただ単に、\nみんなの気持ちを受け取りたかっただけだ。", "zh": "不，我只是很遗憾没能收下\n大家送我的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1046_011ami", "source_sha256": "b9964613cde4827aa4b07d8a08845ae524be37444cd091aae2332e9066e3e893", "ja": "ゴフッ。\nい、今のは全罰ゲームより効いたよ、兄ちゃん……。", "zh": "哦唔！\n刚、刚才那句话比任何惩罚游戏都还有效喔，大哥哥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1047_005yay", "source_sha256": "12ae5df2e9e217c2f64f9081e58baf0e07ae7843a42ef9513c97baee766c998a", "ja": "亜美、反省してるなら、私も手伝うよ！\nふたりでやればすぐだから、頑張ろうね？", "zh": "亚美，如果你在反省了，我也会帮忙的！\n两个人一起很快就会做好，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1048_011ami", "source_sha256": "8d562da24f5e3437cc32505fe3c893ab8cc6b7572a64169d19c8cf3a3d8eb3da", "ja": "やよいっち優しいね……。うう、亜美、反省する……。\n3日くらい、めっちゃ反省する～！", "zh": "阿弥人真好……呜呜，亚美要反省……\n而且要认真反省三天～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1049_007ior", "source_sha256": "7bc7f83c46d7949c2690c72b55ae21496420696b67dbdc7ab6da622438fb4c7e", "ja": "やれやれ、しょうがないわね……\nやよいがそんなだと、私たちも怒れないじゃない。", "zh": "唉，真拿你没办法……\n弥生这个样子，我们也没办法生气了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_1050", "source_sha256": "c89f9ff18e0c9fad46a49c889100e089f15967ad49a5cb7861a0ee57d579f962", "ja": "許す", "zh": "原谅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1c90bf2451f7a3ef9b8289ef40f5a8a34e7b5a8215e4c82f27c705853af05640", "ja": "そうだな、許そう。みんなの気持ちそのものが、俺には\n一番のプレゼントだからな。それは確かに受け取った！", "zh": "好吧，我原谅你。毕竟对我来说，\n大家的心意才是最好的礼物，而且我已经确实收到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_2001_p", "source_sha256": "921335819cae8839ad5e31bd3816236e2acf6a650eb7ab03c2c1ab7f864d3444", "ja": "じゃあ、片付けはみんなでやろうか！", "zh": "那么，大家一起整理吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_2002_013hib", "source_sha256": "79d2db1a4569b6d7a58f8fd41a99ae20e287ad94c6cd13fe9296b8873e93e4c0", "ja": "そうだねっ！　みんなでやれば、\nすぐ終わっちゃうさー！", "zh": "也对！大家一起整理，\n马上就会整理完啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_2003_009rit", "source_sha256": "ed694ccafeb26a9f36b82c0770cf1534c0559b355a4c4163007089c5a1a61447", "ja": "そうと決まれば、分担してテキパキやっちゃいましょ。", "zh": "既然决定好了，就分工合作，快点整理干净吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_2004_011ami", "source_sha256": "05c0cb872e10d28f517bf3aa38d1dc5e51d37096c155ea080fa62bb37d3c3594", "ja": "みんな……ありがとう、本当にありがとう……\nじゃあ亜美は、みんなに指示する係やるから！", "zh": "大家……谢谢，真的谢谢你们……\n那亚美就负责给大家下达指示！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_2005_009rit", "source_sha256": "3ab53dfcf2336fd611b00e997259a0a9c34bd3be5eec9e81617232ca0b28bbb8", "ja": "……亜美？", "zh": "……亚美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_2006_011ami", "source_sha256": "57771baa8547bb6034ac097bfb121d05af4a47f77ccaa9ffa5f564833fd4ba8b", "ja": "という冗談は、置いときまして～。　\n軍曹殿、亜美はごみ袋をとってくるであります！", "zh": "这种玩笑就先抛到一边～\n教官大人，亚美这就去拿垃圾袋来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_2007_007ior", "source_sha256": "dc78810411c5f6505af93c16672202c852cfd044fb1a01d8b500c1f5d54b31aa", "ja": "……フン、結局いつもどおりって感じね。\nま、いいわ。その方がやりやすいし……。", "zh": "……哼，结果还是跟平常一样嘛。\n算了，这样比较好做事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_2008_007ior", "source_sha256": "29394fd661b44843ee36a8085d3cd37d0a116f89aeafb2240cd48c4bc371ed0f", "ja": "気分も、悪くないし！　……にひひっ♪", "zh": "而且，感觉也不坏嘛……咿嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_2009_p", "source_sha256": "40e23f760070cbd9fb87573dade5fbf5d7d9f8506485019af17428765601976e", "ja": "（大きな舞台をみんなでやり遂げて、\n心の底からリラックスできる……）", "zh": "（大家一起完成盛大的表演，\n才能打从心底放松下来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_07_2010_p", "source_sha256": "44a608baa49762fe756339bde5085da4146e70a24ef30fc19a20165bc21031fc", "ja": "（そんな日常を送りながら、また次の舞台へ。\n彼女達の伝説は、まだ始まったばかりだ！）", "zh": "（在这种日常生活里，她们将迈向下一个舞台。\n她们的传说现在才刚开始！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
